# A 仮身 of ファイル変換 carried before the program asks the desktop, on the x64 PC
# (tools/x64/ui_run64.py): tools/tests/ui_xfc_carry.steps with the disks of the q35
# machine: /boot is nvmea0, second in the list of ファイル変換 at 182,175; its rows stand
# where those of vblka1 do (nvmea0, EFI, SUB, then the files), so the rest as there.
# A 仮身 of ファイル変換 carried with the pointer moved straight after the press,
# before the program has asked the desktop to carry it (design 10.4), for
# tools/ui_run.py. In the shot, what follows the pointer must be the 仮身
# pressed (the row of .ico, turned over), held where it was pressed, and not
# what lay further along the way the pointer went.
dclick 80 141
wait 1500
open 01a0d8c4-52b1-7c21-9a31-4f5e6d7c8b91
expect xfconv: ready
wait 500
dclick 182 175
expect xfconv: window nvmea0
wait 800
win nvmea0
hold 300 343
move 330 353
move 360 363
move 420 383
wait 400
move 800 620
wait 300
shot xfc_carry
up
wait 800
